# italki

> italki is an online language learning marketplace that connects learners with real teachers for live, personalized 1-on-1 and group lessons across 150+ languages.

italki helps learners improve speaking, listening, pronunciation, grammar, vocabulary, exam preparation, business communication, travel language, relocation readiness, and cultural fluency through human-led online lessons.

## Quick Facts

- Company: italki
- Category: Online language learning marketplace
- Primary offering: Live online language lessons with teachers
- Secondary offerings: Lesson-focused study tools, learning content, and a learning community.
- Lesson formats: Private 1-on-1 lessons and live group classes
- Learners: 15M+
- Teachers: 30K+
- Languages supported: 150+
- Platforms: Web, iOS, Android
- Pricing model: Pay per lesson; no monthly subscription required for private lessons
- Teacher types: Professional Teachers and Community Tutors
- Lesson-focused study tools: lesson summaries, homework, vocabulary flashcards, listening and speaking practice tools, and pronunciation tools.

